["ok","% do { let {(ctxt, tc, tvs, tparms) = unLoc happy_var_3}\u000a                                             -- can have type pats\u000a\u0009\u0009      ; return $\u000a\u0009\u0009\u0009  L (comb4 happy_var_1 happy_var_3 happy_var_4 happy_var_5)\u000a\u0009\u0009\u0009           -- We need the location on tycl_hdr in case \u000a\u0009\u0009\u0009\u0009   -- constrs and deriving are both empty\u000a\u0009\u0009\u0009    (mkTyData (unLoc happy_var_1) (ctxt, tc, tvs, Just tparms) \u000a\u0009\u0009\u0009      Nothing (reverse (unLoc happy_var_4)) (unLoc happy_var_5)) }",[5,4,1,5,4,3,1,3]]
